&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Partner Solution Architect, GSI to join our team. This is a Hybrid role, reporting to the Director, Solutions Consulting in the WW Alliances &amp;amp; Channels department. The Partner Solution Architect (PSA) serves as the primary technical champion for Zscaler’s Global System Integrator (GSI) partners, responsible for building technical competency and excellence within GSI’s security practices. You will partner closely with the business stakeholders to design scalable reference architectures and lead high-impact enablement programs for GSI architects and delivery teams. By bridging the gap between Zscaler technology and GSI service offerings, you ensure our partners can successfully architect, pilot, and drive AI and Zero Trust transformations for their largest global clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
