&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;Drive opportunity acceleration in GSI partner-led large sales scenarios, providing technical expertise to expand account Sales Engineer efforts and highlight the potential of the Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
