&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;Lead strategic enablement by collaborating with GSI sales engineers to develop their technical capabilities, ensuring independent delivery of high-quality demonstrations, architecture workshops, and Proof of Values (POVs)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;Elevate industry visibility as a technical thought leader through the creation of reference architectures, white papers, blogs, and public speaking at industry and corporate events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Provide technical advisory support, education, and mentorship to the global partner engineering team without direct people management responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Foster solution co-innovation by collaborating with GSI Centers of Excellence (CoE) to build differentiated, industry-specific solutions that wrap GSI services around the Zscaler platform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
