&lt;li&gt;4+ years of dedicated experience in Business Insights and Analytics functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Snowflake, SQL, Google Spreadsheets, Streamlit, Python, and DBT, with an understanding of Prompt Engineering for Gen AI solutions&lt;/li&gt;
