&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Partner Business Manager, GSI to join our team. This is a hybrid position based in Bangalore role, reporting to the Sr. Director, Alliance Partners in the WW Alliances &amp;amp; Channels department. This role will lead the strategic expansion of our platform within our Global System Integrator (GSI) ecosystem. This is a high-impact, &quot;builder&quot; role that requires a unique blend of technical depth, commercial acumen, and the ability to influence large, complex organizations. You will be responsible for architecting the technical and business value proposition that allows GSIs to wrap their services around Zscaler, ensuring that Zscaler remains the definitive security anchor for their multi-million dollar digital transformation projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
