&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Oversee the technical Proof of Value (PoV) process within GSI accounts, ensuring that technical success criteria are directly aligned with the commercial milestones of a larger digital transformation contract&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
