&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Enable and educate internal GSI teams while serving as the definitive voice of the partner to synthesize field feedback and influence the Zscaler platform roadmap&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
