&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You focus on team success over individual ambition, welcoming candid feedback delivered with clarity and respect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You possess a relentless growth mindset, continuously seeking out development opportunities to become a better teammate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated curiosity and active exploration of AI tools, with a proven history of integrating new technologies to enhance daily workflows and augment problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in Java coding in a highly distributed and enterprise-scale environment with experience in Kafka, Druid, ElasticSearch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience being on-call and dealing with cloud incidents and writing RCAs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of cloud infrastructure services on AWS or Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
