&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Staff Detection Engineer to join our team. This is a Hybrid (Pune, India) role, reporting to the Senior Manager in the Threat Hunting department. You will combine threat research and engineering expertise to build the next generation of detections across AWS and cloud infrastructures. By leveraging big data platforms like Hadoop and Athena, you will design scalable hunting logic and automated pipelines to defend our global footprint and enhance threat visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
