&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;Develop YAML-based detections and SIGMA-like rule technologies while migrating existing hunting detections to next-generation systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Utilize data platforms like Hadoop, Athena, and data lakes to monitor and test new intelligence sources for enhanced threat visibility&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Independently write detections and playbooks while supporting operational demands, including weekend night shifts and on-call rotations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
