&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Staff Software Development Engineer to join our team. This is a Hybrid (Bangalore, India) role, reporting to the Sr Manager of Engineering, Cyber Security and Data Protection in the Cyber Security and Data Protection Engineering department. You will build quality into products that secure mobile devices, applications, and data for millions of users who rely on our service for comprehensive protection and data security. Our team develops innovative solutions across web filtering, policy enforcement, next-gen firewalls, and CASB, utilizing real-time analytics to provide unmatched visibility through a state-of-the-art NOC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
