&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Staff Threat Researcher to join our team. This is a Hybrid role, reporting to the leader in the Threat Detection Group in the ThreatLabz department. The Staff Threat Researcher will be primarily responsible for performing static and dynamic malware analysis, developing protections, and conducting reputation analysis on extracted IOCs. This role will also design threat research automation workflows and create testing and training datasets for ML models to ensure millions of global users on the Zscaler platform remain protected.&lt;/p&gt;
