&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;Conduct static and dynamic malware analysis to mitigate emerging threats, C2 frameworks, and malicious AI agents&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;Develop complex automation tools, prototypes, and detection signatures to integrate research findings into Zscaler products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;Track the global threat landscape, identify attacker TTPs, and perform reputation analysis on extracted IOCs&lt;/p&gt;
