&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Validate AI/ML model outputs and provide feedback to the engineering teams to enhance threat model efficacy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Contribute to the global security community by publishing in-depth threat analysis blogs and research papers&lt;/p&gt;
